(x => x(x))(y => y(y))(())
//│ Parsed Core: ((λx. x x) (λy. y y)) ()
//│ Inferred: α
//│ As term: α
//│ |> x, α0, x -> ∀α1. (x)^m1 ≤ (x)^m2 -> α1 => α1 ≤ (∀y. y -> ∀α2. (y)^m3 ≤ (y)^m4 -> α2 => α2) -> α0, α, α0 ≤ () -> α
//│ ====== (1) ======
//│ Front: x
//│ Rule: C-Promote
//│ Remaining: 4
//│ ====== (2) ======
//│ Front: α0
//│ Rule: C-Promote
//│ Remaining: 3
//│ ====== (3) ======
//│ Front: x -> ∀α1. (x)^m1 ≤ (x)^m2 -> α1 => α1 ≤ (∀y. y -> ∀α2. (y)^m3 ≤ (y)^m4 -> α2 => α2) -> α0
